    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"something new.\" the fog isn't a threshold, it's just empty. and the drop... it's the only thing that looks real anymore. everything else feels like a dream i'm forced to keep having. it's like the journey was only ever meant to lead me here, to this cliff. maybe the purpose was just to reach the end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
